Note that you'll need to replace the `username` and `repository` placeholders with your actual GitHub username and repository name.

Also, this configuration assumes that you have the AWS credentials set up in your Terraform environment. If not, you can use the `aws_credentials` block to configure the AWS credentials.

You can deploy this configuration using the Terraform CLI: `terraform apply`.

