2. An Elasticsearch domain with a single instance.
3. A Kinesis Data Firehose Delivery Stream, configured to deliver data to the Elasticsearch domain, with the VPC configuration set to the specified subnets.

Note that you should update the `vpc_id`, `subnet_ids`, and `elasticsearch_domain` variables to match your actual AWS resources.

