* An Amazon Kinesis Analytics Application with a single stream as the input source and a CloudWatch log stream as the output destination.
* A CloudWatch Log Group and Stream.
* A Kinesis Stream.
* An IAM Role and Policy for Kinesis Analytics.
* An IAM Policy Attachment to the IAM Role.

Note that this is a basic configuration and may need to be customized to fit your specific use case.

