Note that this configuration assumes that you have the "lambda.js" file in the same directory as the Terraform configuration file. Also, make sure to replace the `region` variable with the region you want to deploy to.

To deploy this configuration, you'll need to create a file named "lambda.js" in the same directory as the Terraform configuration file, and run `terraform init` and `terraform apply` to create the AWS resources.

