    name = "min_connections"
    value = "10"
  }
}
```

This configuration will create a custom DAX parameter group named `custom-dax-parameter-group` in the `us-west-2` region. The group will be based on the `DAX-1.3` family and will include three custom parameters:

1. `ttl` (time to live) set to 300 seconds (5 minutes)
2. `max_connections` set to 100 connections
3. `min_connections` set to 10 connections

Note: Make sure you have the necessary permissions to create DAX resources in the region you specified. Also, this configuration is a basic example and you may need to adjust it according to your specific requirements.

