This configuration defines the following resources:

* An AWS MSK cluster with 3 broker nodes
* A security group for the MSK cluster
* A subnet for the MSK cluster
* A CloudWatch log group for logging MSK cluster events
* An IAM role and policy for the MSK cluster to log to the CloudWatch log group
