* An IAM role for the Lambda function with the necessary permissions
* An IAM policy for the Lambda function with the necessary permissions
* An IAM role policy attachment for the Lambda function
* A new Lambda function with the necessary permissions
* A new CloudWatch log group for the Lambda function
* A new EventBridge rule to trigger the Lambda function every day at 7 UTC
* A new EventBridge target to invoke the Lambda function
* A new EventBridge permission for the Lambda function

Note that you will need to replace the `lambda_function_payload.zip` file with your own Lambda function code. Also, make sure to update the `region` variable to your preferred AWS region.

